3. When you learn a concrete value, call `collect_slots` with `updates: {slot_name: value}` to record it.
4. Only when `collect_slots` returns `status: "complete"` may you invoke any write (`:write`) or critical (`:critical`) tool.
5. Never invent slot values. If the user refuses or cannot provide them, hand off.
